      "id": "sol.amc-10b-2013-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "\\[ \\begin{aligned} &\\frac{2+4+6}{1+3+5} - \\frac{1+3+5}{2+4+6} \\\\ \\ &= \\dfrac {12}9 - \\dfrac 9{12} \\\\ &= \\dfrac 43 - \\dfrac 34 \\\\ &= \\dfrac 7{12} \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
